{"alias":"/schools/safeschools/highmobility/homelessed/MVliaisons","title":"Resources for McKinney-Vento Liaisons","changed":"2026-08-31T14:15:19+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Resources for McKinney-Vento Liaisons Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"b3eac0cb-bb1e-4d4e-815b-c087c5c637d0\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Resources%20for%20Liaisons%20Banner.png\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; display:block;\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\">\r\n<h2>Liaison Spotlights</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Liaison Spotlights</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>Learn more about the liaisons and school staff leading McKinney-Vento identification and supports at the local level in the spotlights below.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"7b64d915-61b7-495b-9d43-8a67720b7bbf\" filename=\"McKinney-Vento - Auburn School Deptartment McKinney-Vento Program Highlight - 8.26.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Auburn%20School%20Deptartment%20McKinney-Vento%20Program%20Highlight%20-%208.26.2026.pdf\">Auburn School Department - Sasha Anatasoff</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"245578b4-b2cb-4b74-95ae-b8d674c46a9c\" filename=\"McKinney Vento - Brunswick Spotlight - 6.30.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20Brunswick%20Spotlight%20-%206.30.2026.pdf\">Brunswick School Department — Shawn Lambert</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"ed3c4baf-2b17-4570-b501-02cb9cfa7cc2\" filename=\"McKinney Vento - Sanford Spotlight - 5.29.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20Sanford%20Spotlight%20-%205.29.2026.pdf\">Sanford School Department — Leah Marks &amp; Cecilia Sirianni</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"35a82528-bd6d-4b59-bfbd-31d92082cc12\" filename=\"McKinney Vento - MSAD 57 Spotlight - 4.29.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20MSAD%2057%20Spotlight%20-%204.29.2026.pdf\">RSU 57 — Megan Wakefield</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"df5cc3ed-eff7-42e3-8452-91b30cd2b62b\" filename=\"McKinney Vento - MSAD 17 Spotlight - 3.23.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20MSAD%2017%20Spotlight%20-%203.23.2026.pdf\">MSAD 17 (Oxford Hills) — Steve Ciembroniewicz</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%209%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026%20.pdf\">RSU 9 — Amanda Clark</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%2020%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">RSU 20 — Judy Cohen</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%2010%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">RSU 10 — Kasey Flagg</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Portland%20Public%20Schools%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">Portland Public Schools — Priscila Bitencourt</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Lewiston%20Public%20Schools%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">Lewiston Public Schools — Natasha Turcotte</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FHgGxjzS9AM\" style=\"width:100%;\" title=\"McKinney-Vento Liaison Annual Training\"></iframe>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>McKinney-Vento Liaison Annual Training</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Liaisons can review materials on their own or watch the recorded annual liaison training above (83 mins).</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><strong>New MV Liaisons must complete <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/g/JyvAep2A7Q\">this assessment</a>.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block mt-4\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/recordings\">More MV Professional Learning</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Quick Links for Liaisons\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Quick%20Links%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Quick Links for Liaisons</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/1181\">Maine Laws, Rules, &amp; Guidance</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://nche.ed.gov/homeless-liaison-toolkit/\">U.S. Education Homeless Liaison Toolkit</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://nche.ed.gov/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/new-liaisons.pdf\">Important Information for New Local Liaisons</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://maine.us2.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=a582edd6473e477ef6307c769&amp;id=21283d239d\">Subscribe to the McKinney-Vento Newsletters</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Step-by-step guide for liaisons\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Step-By-Step%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Step-by-Step for Liaisons</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine eligibility under McKinney-Vento — if needed, use <strong>MV Screener Form Option 1</strong>. Document status in the student information system.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">If the student is unaccompanied, determine caregiver if applicable. Use the <strong>Caregiver Template</strong> for general educational decisions.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">If the child is MV, unaccompanied, and identified for Special Education, set up an <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Special%20Education%20Surrogate%20Parent%20Appointment%20Request%20-%207.24.25.pdf\">Educational Surrogate Parent</a>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine best interest for school placement in partnership between the SAUs of origin and residence. <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Parents.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Parents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Immediately enroll in school of residence without normally required documents, or arrange transportation for the child to remain in school of origin in partnership between SAUs.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Provide family/unaccompanied homeless youth/caregiver with information on their right to <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/dispute\" target=\"_blank\">Dispute Resolution</a>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine child's needs to succeed in school — <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney-Vento%20Annual%20Check-In%20Form.docx\">Sample MV Check-In Form / Student Needs Assessment</a>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Connect to referrals based on identified needs. For unaccompanied homeless youth: and <a href=\"https://schoolhouseconnection.org/article/sample-form-letters-to-determine-independent-student-status-of-unaccompanied-homeless-youth-for-the-fafsa\">FAFSA Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Sample Form</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Forms and Templates\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Forms%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Forms &amp; Templates</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"1e81801e-bf7b-4937-9c6c-59a70585b3ce\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/KYR%20Flyers%20%281%29.pdf\">Outreach Flyers</a> — also available in: <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/French%20KYR%20Flyers.pdf\">French</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spanish%20KYR%20Flyers.pdf\">Spanish</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Lingala%20Flyers.pdf\">Lingala</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Portuguese%20KYR%20Flyers%20%282%29.pdf\">Portuguese</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Somali%20KYR%20Flyers%20%282%29.pdf\">Somali</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20Haitian%20Creole.pdf\">Haitian Creole</a>, <a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20Flier-Arabic.pdf\">Arabic</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">*<a class=\"file file--mime-application-msword file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"d3bc9969-4bf9-46a7-abf4-5046c5dee5e6\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20MV%20Screener.doc\">SAMPLE MV Screener</a> — include in electronic enrollment or back to school</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f44183f6-ea85-4571-8119-75722446f8b2\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20new%20McKinney%20Vento%20eligibility%20form.docx\">MV Screener Form Option 2</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">*<a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Parents.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Parents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">*<a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"47ace9dc-0ab4-4df4-ad5d-6991d8773f20\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney-Vento%20Annual%20Check-In%20Form.docx\">Sample MV Check-In Form / Student Needs Assessment</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/dispute\" target=\"_blank\">Dispute Resolution</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"04511e53-96dd-4db6-ae46-9a120a8a9586\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney%20Vento%20Referral%20Form%20-%20District.docx\">Confidential Referral Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"765bc857-a2df-4e0c-aff0-857d6813f620\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/sample%20transportation%20agreement%20LEA.docx\">Transportation Agreement Sample</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Resources\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Unaccompanied%20Youth%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"c3ae7375-20bf-4275-9138-4d41d8934657\" filename=\"McKinney-Vento - Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Eligibility Flowchart - 4.15.2026.pdf\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Unaccompanied%20Homeless%20Youth%20Eligibility%20Flowchart%20-%204.15.2026.pdf\">Unaccompanied Youth Eligibility Flow Chart</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">*<a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Caregiver%20Template.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Sample Caregiver Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"file file--mime-application-vnd-openxmlformats-officedocument-wordprocessingml-document file--x-office-document\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"44dbe751-7bc0-4d66-99d6-14eab2dd4606\" filename=\"McKinney-Vento - Maine Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Status Verification Sample Form for Health Care Services - 4.15.2026.docx\" href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Maine%20Unaccompanied%20Homeless%20Youth%20Status%20Verification%20Sample%20Form%20for%20Health%20Care%20Services%20-%204.15.2026.docx\">Sample Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Verification for Medical Consent</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://schoolhouseconnection.org/article/sample-form-letters-to-determine-independent-student-status-of-unaccompanied-homeless-youth-for-the-fafsa\">FAFSA Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Sample Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Unaccompanied-Youth.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Unaccompanied Homeless Youth</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.1800runaway.org\">National Runaway Safeline</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>ARP funds received from the USDOE support the implementation of this project. The project has an award totaling $795,000 dollars of which 100% is federally funded and directly attributed to project implementation. The contents are those of the author(s) and do not necessarily represent the official views of, nor an endorsement, by the USDOE or the U.S. Government.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Signe Lynch</strong><br />\r\n<em>McKinney-Vento Education Specialist</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone:</strong> 207-441-5934<br />\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:Signe.Lynch@maine.gov\">Signe.Lynch@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"liaison-spotlights\">\r\n<h2>Liaison Spotlights</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Liaison Spotlights</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<p>Learn more about the liaisons and school staff leading McKinney-Vento identification and supports at the local level in the spotlights below.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Auburn%20School%20Deptartment%20McKinney-Vento%20Program%20Highlight%20-%208.26.2026.pdf\">Auburn School Department - Sasha Anatasoff</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20Brunswick%20Spotlight%20-%206.30.2026.pdf\">Brunswick School Department — Shawn Lambert</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20Sanford%20Spotlight%20-%205.29.2026.pdf\">Sanford School Department — Leah Marks &amp; Cecilia Sirianni</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20MSAD%2057%20Spotlight%20-%204.29.2026.pdf\">RSU 57 — Megan Wakefield</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney%20Vento%20-%20MSAD%2017%20Spotlight%20-%203.23.2026.pdf\">MSAD 17 (Oxford Hills) — Steve Ciembroniewicz</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%209%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026%20.pdf\">RSU 9 — Amanda Clark</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%2020%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">RSU 20 — Judy Cohen</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20RSU%2010%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">RSU 10 — Kasey Flagg</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Portland%20Public%20Schools%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">Portland Public Schools — Priscila Bitencourt</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Lewiston%20Public%20Schools%20Highlight%20-%203.26.2026.pdf\">Lewiston Public Schools — Natasha Turcotte</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><div class=\"doe-video\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FHgGxjzS9AM\" title=\"McKinney-Vento Liaison Annual Training\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>McKinney-Vento Liaison Annual Training</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Liaisons can review materials on their own or watch the recorded annual liaison training above (83 mins).</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><strong>New MV Liaisons must complete <a href=\"https://forms.office.com/g/JyvAep2A7Q\" target=\"_blank\">this assessment</a>.</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\n<p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-info btn-lg btn-block mt-4\" href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/recordings\">More MV Professional Learning</a></p>\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Quick Links for Liaisons\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Quick%20Links%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Quick Links for Liaisons</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/1181\">Maine Laws, Rules, &amp; Guidance</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://nche.ed.gov/homeless-liaison-toolkit/\" target=\"_blank\">U.S. Education Homeless Liaison Toolkit</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://nche.ed.gov/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/new-liaisons.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Important Information for New Local Liaisons</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://maine.us2.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=a582edd6473e477ef6307c769&amp;id=21283d239d\" target=\"_blank\">Subscribe to the McKinney-Vento Newsletters</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Step-by-step guide for liaisons\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Step-By-Step%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Step-by-Step for Liaisons</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine eligibility under McKinney-Vento — if needed, use <strong>MV Screener Form Option 1</strong>. Document status in the student information system.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">If the student is unaccompanied, determine caregiver if applicable. Use the <strong>Caregiver Template</strong> for general educational decisions.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">If the child is MV, unaccompanied, and identified for Special Education, set up an <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Special%20Services%20-%20Special%20Education%20Surrogate%20Parent%20Appointment%20Request%20-%207.24.25.pdf\">Educational Surrogate Parent</a>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine best interest for school placement in partnership between the SAUs of origin and residence. <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Parents.pdf\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Parents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Immediately enroll in school of residence without normally required documents, or arrange transportation for the child to remain in school of origin in partnership between SAUs.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Provide family/unaccompanied homeless youth/caregiver with information on their right to <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/dispute\">Dispute Resolution</a>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Determine child's needs to succeed in school — <a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney-Vento%20Annual%20Check-In%20Form.docx\">Sample MV Check-In Form / Student Needs Assessment</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span>.</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">Connect to referrals based on identified needs. For unaccompanied homeless youth: and <a href=\"https://schoolhouseconnection.org/article/sample-form-letters-to-determine-independent-student-status-of-unaccompanied-homeless-youth-for-the-fafsa\" target=\"_blank\">FAFSA Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Sample Form</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-4 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Forms and Templates\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Forms%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Forms &amp; Templates</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-item list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/KYR%20Flyers%20%281%29.pdf\">Outreach Flyers</a>  Also available in: <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/French%20KYR%20Flyers.pdf\">French</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Spanish%20KYR%20Flyers.pdf\">Spanish</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Lingala%20Flyers.pdf\">Lingala</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Portuguese%20KYR%20Flyers%20%282%29.pdf\">Portuguese</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Somali%20KYR%20Flyers%20%282%29.pdf\">Somali</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20Haitian%20Creole.pdf\">Haitian Creole</a>, <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20Flier-Arabic.pdf\">Arabic</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\">*<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20MV%20Screener.doc\">SAMPLE MV Screener</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span> — include in electronic enrollment or back to school</li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20new%20McKinney%20Vento%20eligibility%20form.docx\">MV Screener Form Option 2</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">*<a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Parents.pdf\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Parents</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">*<a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney-Vento%20Annual%20Check-In%20Form.docx\">Sample MV Check-In Form / Student Needs Assessment</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/counseling/highmobility/homelessed/dispute\">Dispute Resolution</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/SAMPLE%20McKinney%20Vento%20Referral%20Form%20-%20District.docx\">Confidential Referral Form</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/sample%20transportation%20agreement%20LEA.docx\">Transportation Agreement Sample</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card h-100\"><img alt=\"Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Resources\" class=\"card-img-top\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Unaccompanied%20Youth%20Card.png\" />\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Resources</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Unaccompanied%20Homeless%20Youth%20Eligibility%20Flowchart%20-%204.15.2026.pdf\">Unaccompanied Youth Eligibility Flow Chart</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\">*<a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/Sample%20Caregiver%20Template.pdf\">Sample Caregiver Template</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/McKinney-Vento%20-%20Maine%20Unaccompanied%20Homeless%20Youth%20Status%20Verification%20Sample%20Form%20for%20Health%20Care%20Services%20-%204.15.2026.docx\">Sample Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Verification for Medical Consent</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Word</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://schoolhouseconnection.org/article/sample-form-letters-to-determine-independent-student-status-of-unaccompanied-homeless-youth-for-the-fafsa\" target=\"_blank\">FAFSA Unaccompanied Homeless Youth Sample Form</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/An-Interview-Checklist-For-Supporting-School-Selection-Unaccompanied-Youth.pdf\">Best Interest Determination Interview Checklist — Unaccompanied Homeless Youth</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.1800runaway.org\" target=\"_blank\">National Runaway Safeline</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>ARP funds received from the USDOE support the implementation of this project. The project has an award totaling $795,000 dollars of which 100% is federally funded and directly attributed to project implementation. The contents are those of the author(s) and do not necessarily represent the official views of, nor an endorsement, by the USDOE or the U.S. Government.</p>\r\n\r\n<div id=\"contact\" class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3>Contact</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Signe Lynch</strong><br />\r\n<em>McKinney-Vento Education Specialist</em><br />\r\n<strong>Phone:</strong> 207-441-5934<br />\r\n<strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:Signe.Lynch@maine.gov\">Signe.Lynch@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\n<p class=\"doe-jump\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-top\"><a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a></p>","notes":["1 section header — too few for a contents list."],"decisions":[{"id":"filechip","on":true,"label":"Tag a document link with the format it opens","why":"7 links on this page open a file — 7 Word — and say nothing about it, while others in the same list carry a tag because their author typed one. The format is read from the file name, so the list stops being half-labelled. No link text changes.","value":"7 links"},{"id":"balance","on":true,"label":"Give the cards the width their content needs","why":"1 row holds two cards of very different weight in equal halves, and cards in a row are the same height — so the short one is stretched and the difference shows as empty space. 2.5× — 1090 characters beside 435. Only the column widths change.","value":"1 row"},{"id":"solo","on":true,"label":"Let a lone card use the full width","why":"1 row holds a single card in a part-width column, so it takes a third or a half of the page and the rest is blank. A row of one is not a grid.","value":"1 card"},{"id":"itemdash","on":true,"label":"Drop the dash once the link is set apart","why":"1 of those items separate the link from its description with a dash. The link is now set in the display face at a larger size with a chevron after it, so the dash marks a boundary that is already unmistakable. Only the separator is removed — no word changes.","value":"1 separator"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"1 list item opens with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"1 item"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"McKinney-Vento - Resources for Liaisons Banner.png"},{"id":"descap","on":true,"label":"Start a description with a capital","why":"1 description begins with a small letter, because it used to run on from the link after a dash. The dash is gone and the link now sits above in its own face, so each description opens a line of its own. One character changes and only ever the first.","value":"1 description"}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","target set by destination: 7","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 7","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","images released from inline dimensions: 1","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 6","video wrapped: 1","action links marked: 27"],"findings":[{"name":"video-in-a-card-outside-the-top-slot","n":1,"eg":["video inside the card body"]},{"name":"card-row-holding-one-card","n":1,"eg":["a grid row with one card in it"]}],"safe":true,"audit":{"alias":"/schools/safeschools/highmobility/homelessed/MVliaisons","title":"Resources for McKinney-Vento Liaisons","changed":"2026-08-31T14:15:19+00:00","words":472,"bytes":15333,"fixes":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 50","target set by destination: 7","loose text wrapped in a paragraph: 7","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","images released from inline dimensions: 1","paragraph unwrapped inside a card header: 6","video wrapped: 1","action links marked: 27"],"flags":[],"contentSafe":true,"headings":[{"l":2,"t":"Liaison Spotlights","bh":true},{"l":3,"t":"Contact","bh":false}],"outline":[],"components":{"cards":22,"cardHeaders":6,"cardTitles":0,"accordions":0,"tables":0,"dataTables":0,"contactCube":1,"jumbotron":0,"dcNote":0,"blockheads":1,"videos":1,"images":5,"buttons":1},"access":{"imagesNoAlt":0,"vagueLinkText":[],"emptyLinks":0,"tablesNoScope":0,"multipleH1":0,"inlineColour":0},"links":{"internal":["/doe/node/1181"],"files":["/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/i